<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech central bank to scrap money market restrictions.</title>
<headline>Czech central bank to scrap money market restrictions.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Friday said it planned to remove restrictions on non-residents participating in the local money market after a meeting with top officials at local banks on Tuesday.</p>
